// Checks for the PackageModel closed-list views whose vocabulary is in a
// sibling directory. An embed path may not contain `..`, so a view in
// Manifest/ cannot embed its vocabulary from Lock/. This file sits above both
// and holds each such check. Each constant stops the build and names any view
// case its vocabulary lacks, apart from the cases listed in `outside`.
use jet_foundation.[effect_vocabulary_view_count]

// DepSpec picks from LockSource: each source a manifest names for a dependency
// is a source the lock records.
DEP_SPEC_COUNT: #run effect_vocabulary_view_count("Manifest/Manifest.jet", embed_file("Manifest/Manifest.jet"), "DepSpec", "Lock/Schema.jet", embed_file("Lock/Schema.jet"), "LockSource", [String]{})
